   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Units and quantities",
     "texto": [
      "**Un kilogram de struguri** means «a kilo of grapes». **Niște** goes with an indefinite plural: **niște cartofi** («some potatoes»). For a price per unit, Romanian usually uses the definite article: **Cinci lei kilogramul** («five lei per kilo»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Weight",
     "texto": [
      "**A cântări** means «to weigh». **Cântăresc** can be «I weigh» or «they weigh»; the context shows who is weighing. **Cântăriți** is used to address one person or several people politely."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
